  3. If the earlier script kept copies of your folders, they hold your data unencrypted: restrict them with chmod 700, or delete them once paritydesk works for you.
  4. Install the Claude Code plugin: /plugin marketplace add kazupc/paritydesk, then /plugin install paritydesk@paritydesk.
